{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：22:00 2026-11-19 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱認愛黃澤林後過26歲生日  大騷英文語錄轉行文青風？  遭毒舌網民起底學歷：好Kam\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d283ae3bb598b6a00bce4de09507e34c/2026-11/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_141.png\"/>\n<p>「籃球女神」譚旻萱（Mandy）早前公開與香港「網球一哥」黃澤林（Coleman）的戀情。日前她迎來認愛後的首個生日，正式邁入26歲。譚旻萱隨後在社交平台上發文，分享多張美照並配上英文感言，不料卻引來部分網民的冷嘲熱諷。</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱頻頻放閃 遠赴外地陪男友參賽</h2>\n<p>譚旻萱自公開戀情後不時大方放閃，除了曾晒出「男友視角」的車廂照並寫下「Perfect birthday morning」外，此前更特意陪同男友遠赴外地參賽。近日，她在Instagram分享慶生新相，並在貼文中寫上西班牙文「Vamos」（意指「加油」），被指是隔空為男友打氣。</p>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱是新一代女神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4cd8284acc32fd5a9b81753c3805c50e/2023-12/mandy_15__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱早於中五時已被經理人公司睇中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eab23bca3724c83a37ad805bd04f433e/2023-12/mandy_28__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱樣子甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46c5c4f9acb2eeb912d43f293866fb5e/2023-12/mandy_30__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱身材不錯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59cbec157b5f2bb911dec3253495eab2/2026-02/MandyTam_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱（左一）被爆與黃澤林拍拖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87ce772d60dcd1a9055e856cf12b1cec/2026-11/hambittttt_1793603596_4021359641954602693_183394126_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林早前認愛譚旻萱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec7b7d3d287c5913b4184e0cc3dd8684/2026-11/ENP01P02081126.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林早前出戰比賽，有網民發現其身邊出現譚旻萱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b22b856efb385a2751bacf880f72300/2026-10/a3_33.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱與黃澤林於首爾街頭並肩等過馬路。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c9fb7a7155921a52ed30c6f20be4d98/2026-11/hambittttt_1793603596_4021359632928271145_183394126_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱與男友黃澤林都是運動健將。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7fe2a384bf9e985ae02ba6ff2c957614/2026-11/FB_IMG_1702414834372.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱近日在IG分享慶祝26歲生日的照片，鬧出風波。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5710f3b5574b4adefc555ec057c709c/2026-11/mandy_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱打上不少英文。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/816efb445a3453fbdca8b50a1fa61387/2026-11/mandy_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱狂飆英文金句。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/261b02c4211eeef2e78e7610c43ff0f8/2026-11/mandy_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱營造知性文青的格調。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8edcfb69935a360f66703ed3ec3604c8/2026-11/mandy_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱的英文語錄被網民截圖並瘋傳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1eb8dc6e0ad791999827af5209b718d7/2026-11/mandy_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱被網民嘲諷刻意「扮高深」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/752f6b094205dd91600e7d7dd4d7670c/2026-11/mandy_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱遭大批網民「狙擊」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea6161568e76d7586aa5d05200a3b2f3/2026-11/mandy_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民指譚旻萱行徑極度尷尬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4a9734f14737d9e9083ec65caaae1e9/2026-11/mandy_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱的學歷被翻出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22e9922a3cd337d0aeee416da88d7426/2026-11/mandy_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱寫上西班牙文「Vamos」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a24c785cf02811ef88de49362aceca0/2026-11/mandy_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民討論。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07b7ce509e6a3cc62da7784ee36bed91/2026-11/CAP2_0_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民反應兩極。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a198f6cc5da2939d7e565a9b2ae452b/2026-11/CAP1_0_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱是新一代女神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b35053104d90c0343b1766d58cb6a90/2023-12/mandy_8__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱樣子甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b9d43a5e76d87d00b2f9056912e1c62/2023-12/mandy_7__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱可走文青風。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7eef5b88bdd13328746739462ee3115/2023-12/mandy_10__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱動靜皆宜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21fbfec58ace2ff98360a63b56c67688/2023-12/mandy_16__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱是運動健將。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/711c6e2b9ac7297fe55a34ccb3a7785b/2023-12/mandy_19__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱成為女團成員出道前，曾接受兩年特訓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0807b3ce87dd41cc8ace9d43908711ff/2023-12/mandy_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱就讀中三時開始打籃球，是「籃球女神」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35ec5424727ae3e6e46a89765d2225dd/2023-12/mandy_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱曾屬籃球隊活躍成員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c51665b89e42dc6c0b5c1898ee8c688b/2023-12/mandy_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱身高達177cm。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7d034e47bdbc98e9eb96b46d5b74b90/2023-12/mandy_47_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱球技出色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a728356f60480d5c773ace7cf0eb2e9/2023-12/mandy_64_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>譚旻萱美照配英文金句</h2>\n<p>譚旻萱在每張照片上，配上長短不一的英文感性語錄。例如與友人的合照中，寫下「leave me carrying only the love, the growth, and the quiet moments that made even the hard days beautiful」，而在自己吹蠟燭的獨照上，配文「leave a little light behind」及「26 starts now」，營造知性文青的格調。</p>\n<h2>網民反應兩極 起底學歷指「行為尷尬」</h2>\n<p>然而，這番英文感言卻意外引發網民熱議。有網民認為她的舉動過於做作，甚至將其英文語錄截圖在網絡上瘋傳。更有網民起底其學歷背景，留言調侃：「英文水平：荔景天主教中學band 2中五」、「其實英文不好就不要張張寫英文，很Kam（尷尬）」、「英文版大文豪」、「裝作ABC」等。不過，亦有粉絲力撐她寫得有心思，雙方在網上掀起兩極討論。</p>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱於2017年出道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb75f69a9a86cf4462def3c57d457901/2023-12/mandy_6__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱是女團Me&amp;成員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62feecffc44d8706a6897d6fbbcb02a6/2023-12/mandy_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱所屬的女團Me&amp;，於2023年出道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a361837ac55997868891578db168c19b/2023-12/mandy_9__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱在《夜王》存在感好強。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d0bea93c4e0ced8c4c0967cf31108f1/2026-02/MandyTam_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱在賀歲片《夜王》演夜總會女公關「ChiLing」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6b293734fa766e6f670ae7c77fd0a82/2026-02/MandyTam_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱飾演的夜總會女公關「ChiLing」，非常寸嘴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b820d1d1101b3a7749701a5e1efcb6f2/2026-02/MandyTam_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱入行時間短，但已有不少作品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/176afbceb5fa4fbf194cb2e871c993c4/2023-12/mandy_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱入行時間短，但已有不少作品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/169e03a09ae3e04d5e51f6f154b721b6/2023-12/mandy_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱為Edan拍《E先生連環不幸事件》MV，打開知名度。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a74096f450a9d413463922f578fee1ca/2023-12/mandy_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《E先生連環不幸事件》MV\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de92657ba8a7ccc34e5a9bf13bdb511c/2023-12/mandy_53_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱與台灣文藝男神陳昊森演出愛情片《不是你不愛你》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3aee29b83619b93093b14be94d5a3254/2023-12/KM_230806__K2_05653-_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱被爆出拍拖消息，未有刻意隱瞞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c4edbfbf644190be4f290f1c844fbdd/2023-12/mandy_65_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱日前貼出情侶鞋打卡，高調晒愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5061d556b0fb3076240d38961cc84ceb/2023-12/mandy_4__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱的限時動態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6204e755763b3c0510593f96d4c8e03/2023-12/mandy_1__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Christopher曾貼出的自拍，玻璃倒影見到疑似譚旻萱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90844ec14d1a2e81e84c519c993d0ee9/2023-12/mandy_66_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱2023年8月拍廣告，身後的男子就是Christopher。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cae4a1cb74d9b3700d89aedd99a578d1/2023-12/mandy_3__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱2023年8月拍攝快餐店廣告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/723d51a2ca65260f1aca1d4180fa36d2/2023-12/cap_1__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有指譚旻萱的廣告由男友Christopher操刀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d367db226519435604545a87cb2cb74/2023-12/cap_4__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱在廣告中好活潑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31457238c37936ce1b72e85b30b04328/2023-12/cap_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱在廣告中散發仙氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e91401119b4ba6feea9f0c3b8d9a257e/2023-12/cap_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱在海邊拍攝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c6a578bbc9a207316a2c0d582ce42502/2023-12/cap_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱一臉享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f6e5cc8b764b84d6a71d6fd532feab5/2023-12/cap_13__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱在廣告中有唱歌鏡頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c60a1e5d3a3f174511533b6f1e115344/2023-12/cap_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱大展歌喉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2cfbd715adb5b43de8799397e540756/2023-12/cap_18__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱在海邊唱歌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2fd3de2984d8e586b1d41211b672cec0/2023-12/cap_19__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱未知是否因廣告合作，而與Christopher撻著。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68235e1d0ba3c75fc283461098199266/2023-12/cap_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚旻萱曾拍過不少廣告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1e486e39bd533fb07cf7b5582481174/2023-12/cap_20_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:28.242238+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":700,"images":59,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T19:56:34.946373+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:51.285324+00:00","content_hash":"174cd74968569cd9c4f7a71a9b9139f2077fd17c1e6b0c7a565e3ab5788726be","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}